Robotic_Arm3.slx is the simulink model for simscape, where the frames of the joints were assigned to match the frames drawn on the DH-Convention table, the default position of the robot is shown in the simscape_model.png screenshot, and the block diagram is shown in a different screenshot as well.
The video attached, shows the frames of all joints and the end effector in my default position, however, the robot's default position is different in coppeliasim and in the DH-Convention, so different angles will be used (usually a difference of 45 degrees).

The positions in X,Y,Z are mostly within a repspectable tolerance, due to inaucraccies in setting the exact posiiton of the end effector frame, and mismatch in initial base orientation
